{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HreU441twCubDgdHUto21H","type":"tool_result","content":"=== manifest sec3 heads ===\n1:# ds4-vllm lift manifest — exact, pinned\n18:## 0. Executive corrections to the campaign record\n33:## 1. The routing power-of-2 fix (the one MANDATORY patch)\n35:### 1.1 Location — re-pinned, record confirmed\n53:### 1.2 The hunk, quoted verbatim (patch:1355-1368)\n85:### 1.3 Adjacent hunks it depends on (the MoE \"latching\" set)\n142:## 2. The two ADAPT files\n144:### 2.1 `SITE/ds4_topk.py` — 457 lines [M] (MANIFEST \"new (457)\" ✅ matches)\n167:# patch:783-795\n207:### 2.2 `SITE/ds4_tl_indexer.py` — 594 lines [M] (⚠ MANIFEST:38 says \"new (476)\" — **STALE by 118 lines**)\n261:### 2.3 `cached_bf16_weight` hook — RE-PINNED\n310:### 2.4 hadamard128 / fp4_act_quant warning comments — TWO locations\n315:# --- DS4_IDX_OFFICIAL=1: reproduce the official DeepSeek-V4 indexer QAT graph ---\n316:# The official inference graph (HF snapshot inference/model.py Indexer.forward and\n317:# Compressor.forward with rotate=True) applies, to BOTH indexer Q rows and indexer\n318:# compressor K rows, after RoPE:\n319:#     x -> hadamard128(x) / sqrt(128) -> fp4_act_quant(x, block=32, inplace)   (QAT sim)\n320:# before the relu(q.k)*w scoring. ds4.c implements the same (dsv4_indexer_qat_*),\n321:# and its comment warns the top-k selection \"is not the model's graph\" without it.\n322:# vLLM's FP8 indexer path skips both steps. ...\n352:## 3. The three VENDOR instruments\n358:### 3.1 `SITE/ds4_synctrace.py` — 93 lines [M] (MANIFEST \"new (93)\" ✅)\n389:### 3.2 `SITE/ds4_expert_union.py` — 128 lines [M] (MANIFEST \"new (128)\" ✅)\n429:### 3.3 `SITE/ds4_offload_batch.py` — 154 lines [M] (⚠ MANIFEST:78 says \"new (102)\" — **STALE by 52 lines**)\n481:## 4. Container discipline\n483:### 4.1 `container/Dockerfile` — 122 lines [M]\n505:### 4.2 How patches are applied at build — the two mechanisms\n508:# Dockerfile:75-77\n534:### 4.3 `container/patches/MANIFEST.md` — 100 lines [M], structure to replicate\n559:### 4.4 ⚠ Three \"new (N)\" counts are wrong — MEASURED\n585:### 4.5 `container/verify-patches.sh` — 95 lines [M]: how it proves base → rootfs\n615:### 4.6 `tests/test_patchset_packaging.py` — 233 lines, 12 tests, all passing [M]\n654:## 5. `host/` — every file, one line each, plus the env/perf inventory\n656:### 5.1 File inventory\n672:### 5.2 `ds4-config.yaml` keys — all 14 (`:5-18`) [S]\n691:### 5.3 The env/perf settings inventory the campaign asked for — each pinned\n711:### 5.4 ⚠ `ds4-cluster-env.sh` MoE knobs — record cite `:127` RE-PINNED\n737:### 5.5 Cluster restart script — the two things it encodes (`ds4-cluster-restart.sh:8-23`)\n763:### 5.6 Teardown (`ds4-cluster-down.sh`) [S]\n769:### 5.7 Warmup (`ds4-vllm-warmup.py`) [S]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"713d6b25-2488-4764-85ea-d835dcd04685","uuid":"fac80d34-55b0-4503-bdb3-79172d826125","timestamp":"2026-08-30T04:02:13.250Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== manifest sec3 heads ===\n1:# ds4-vllm lift manifest — exact, pinned\n18:## 0. Executive corrections to the campaign record\n33:## 1. The routing power-of-2 fix (the one MANDATORY patch)\n35:### 1.1 Location — re-pinned, record confirmed\n53:### 1.2 The hunk, quoted verbatim (patch:1355-1368)\n85:### 1.3 Adjacent hunks it depends on (the MoE \"latching\" set)\n142:## 2. The two ADAPT files\n144:### 2.1 `SITE/ds4_topk.py` — 457 lines [M] (MANIFEST \"new (457)\" ✅ matches)\n167:# patch:783-795\n207:### 2.2 `SITE/ds4_tl_indexer.py` — 594 lines [M] (⚠ MANIFEST:38 says \"new (476)\" — **STALE by 118 lines**)\n261:### 2.3 `cached_bf16_weight` hook — RE-PINNED\n310:### 2.4 hadamard128 / fp4_act_quant warning comments — TWO locations\n315:# --- DS4_IDX_OFFICIAL=1: reproduce the official DeepSeek-V4 indexer QAT graph ---\n316:# The official inference graph (HF snapshot inference/model.py Indexer.forward and\n317:# Compressor.forward with rotate=True) appli