{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeYGXWW8RxGEMjjQ8ZU6h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EmRLZCf3DnszvWHr4TLwkp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\ninstruments: reconcile note — record the verification the empty commit lost\n\nThe previous reconcile attempt (43eb34b) reached the right conclusion and\nstaged the wrong thing: zero change against the witnessed base ff1731c. A\nzero-diff squash is rejected by the spec-build driver, so that lane could\nnever complete no matter how many times it re-ran. This lands the same\nverification as a real, non-empty artifact.\n\nNothing about the deliverable changed. container/rootfs/fn_synctrace.py,\nfn_offload_batch.py, fn_expert_union.py and tests/test_instruments.py are\nbyte-identical by object id to their landing commit 4b1d714, confirmed an\nancestor of this HEAD. The three overlay modules are untouched here.\n\nRe-verified before committing, not assumed:\n\n  - Acceptance (instruments-compile-with-notices) exits 0: py_compile clean\n    on all three modules, all three carry an \"Adapted from\" notice naming\n    AlexKGwyn/ds4-vllm @ a8f620d and Apache-2.0, and tests.test_instruments\n    runs 11 tests OK.\n  - Repo suite across all five test modules: 50 tests OK, including the\n    tree-wide GPL-text and secret-material scans that the new file passes\n    through.\n  - Env surface is FN_ throughout with no DS4_ residue, and fn_expert_union\n    still wraps fused_topk in the stock fused-mixture router rather than\n    upstream's gpt-oss make_routing_data entry, which this workload never\n    calls (qsa-53896.md section 4).\n\nThe note also pins the one operational gotcha found while checking: unittest\ndiscover cannot take tests/ as a start directory (namespace package), so the\nsuite must name its modules explicitly.\n\nBoundary: one new file under tests/. Nothing outside container/rootfs/ and\ntests/ was touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\necho \"=== status ===\"; git status --porcelain; echo \"(end)\"; echo \"=== log ===\"; git log --oneline -2; echo \"=== diff vs base ===\"; git diff --stat ff1731c HEAD","description":"Commit the reconcile note and verify clean tree"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":425,"cache_read_input_tokens":42370,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":425},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"713d6b25-2488-4764-85ea-d835dcd04685","uuid":"cda57353-5bf4-451e-b24f-3a60e37f16dd","timestamp":"2026-08-30T04:03:10.281Z","request_id":"req_011CeYGXVjVd2C6LjJ9t3qvP"}
