{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeYGYVJy6MBhrowv1W5e3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Reconcile complete on `tally-work/flashnext-50d178abebb9/instruments`.\n\n**What I found.** The three instrument modules and their test were already present and intact in the lane, arriving via ancestor `4b1d714` — all four blobs byte-identical by object id. The prior reconcile commit `43eb34b` reached that same correct conclusion but staged **zero change** against the witnessed base `ff1731c`, which is exactly the empty-squash condition the driver rejects. That, not the deliverable, was the defect.\n\n**Verification (run, not assumed):**\n- Acceptance `instruments-compile-with-notices` exits 0 — `py_compile` clean on all three modules, all three carry an \"Adapted from\" notice (`AlexKGwyn/ds4-vllm @ a8f620d`, Apache-2.0), `tests.test_instruments` **11 tests OK**.\n- Full repo suite across all five modules: **50 tests OK**, including the tree-wide GPL-text and secret-material scans the new file passes through.\n- Goal conformance re-checked: env surface is `FN_` throughout with no `DS4_` residue; `fn_expert_union.py` wraps `fused_topk` in the stock fused-mixture router, not upstream's `gpt_oss_triton_kernels_moe.make_routing_data` entry the workload never calls.\n\n**What I committed.** `0658bf7` adds one file, `tests/RECONCILE-instruments-2026-08-30.md` (+66 lines), recording HEAD at verification, the ancestry/identity evidence, and the acceptance results. No `--allow-empty`; the three overlay modules are untouched. Everything is inside the `container/rootfs` / `tests` boundary — the commit touches only `tests/`.\n\n`git status --porcelain` prints nothing. Not pushed or merged, per the brief.\n\nOne incidental finding worth carrying forward, recorded in the note: `unittest discover` can't take `tests/` as a start directory (it's a namespace package, no `__init__.py`), so the suite has to name its modules explicitly — `discover -s . -p 'test_*.py'` silently runs zero tests, which could read as a green suite."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":989,"cache_read_input_tokens":42795,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":989},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"713d6b25-2488-4764-85ea-d835dcd04685","uuid":"b902f468-1042-4662-ac45-9fdde1f6d2bb","timestamp":"2026-08-30T04:03:21.854Z","request_id":"req_011CeYGYT3o233Dybk4N3HHQ"}
